    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You gain the following benefits.</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency.</strong> You gain proficiency with Alchemist's Supplies and the Herbalism Kit. If you already have one of these proficiencies, you gain proficiency with one other type of Artisan's Tools of your choice (or two other types if you have both).</p><p><strong>Potion Crafting.</strong> When you brew a potion with the crafting rules of the Dungeon Master's Guide, the time it takes is halved.</p>",
